DESCRIPTION:Project: City Planning & Development Review Community Consulta
 tion Meetings\n\nThe application proposes to amend the Zoning By-law to pe
 rmit a to permit a 45-storey mixed-use building providing residential and 
 commercial at grade. The building will provide a total of 699 residential 
 units\, being a mix of 1-bedroom\, 1-bedroom+den\, 2-bedroom\, and 3-bedro
 om units. The building will also provide retail units at grade. Access fro
 m Canterbury Place will be provided\, leading to 3 levels of below-grade p
 arking\, providing 197 parking spaces\; as well as 531 bicycle parking spa
 ces. The proposed development provides a total GFA of 41\,339.89 square me
 tres and a FSI of 12.05.\n\nType: In person
LOCATION:St. George on Yonge Anglican Church (Parish Hall)\, 5350 Yonge St
 reet\, North York\, ON\, Canada
